{"id":"31aff49e22ab64ab","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-regular-epimorphism-regular-category.md","title":"Definition — Regular Epimorphism and Regular Category","display":"Definition — Regular Epimorphism and Regular Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-regular-epimorphism-regular-category","aliases":["14-df-regular-epimorphism-regular-category"],"display":"Definition — Regular Epimorphism and Regular Category","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","[[14-df-morphism]]","[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-regular-epimorphism-regular-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-regular-epimorphism-regular-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Regular Epimorphism and Regular Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 为候选箭头。有限极限、单态射、Hom 和拉回见所列内部依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\mathrm{dom}(e)\">\\(A=\\mathrm{dom}(e)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\mathrm{cod}(e)\">\\(B=\\mathrm{cod}(e)\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(e\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> 分支中使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsRegularEpi}(e)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;e\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists p,q\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(R,\\mathrm{dom}(e))\\\n\\bigl(e\\circ p=e\\circ q\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\mathrm{dom}(e),X)\\\n(h\\circ p=h\\circ q\\to\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\mathrm{cod}(e),X)\\ (u\\circ e=h))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsRegular}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\exists I\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists e,m\\\n(e\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,I)\\land m\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I,B)\\land f=m\\circ e\\land\\mathrm{IsRegularEpi}(e)\\land\\mathrm{IsMono}(m))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,B&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall e\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B&#39;,B)\\\n(\\mathrm{IsRegularEpi}(e)\\to\\forall P,p,e&#39;\\ (\\mathrm{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal E}(P,p,e&#39;,e,g)\\to\\mathrm{IsRegularEpi}(e&#39;))).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsRegularEpi}(e)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;e\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists p,q\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(R,\\mathrm{dom}(e))\\\n\\bigl(e\\circ p=e\\circ q\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\mathrm{dom}(e),X)\\\n(h\\circ p=h\\circ q\\to\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\mathrm{cod}(e),X)\\ (u\\circ e=h))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsRegular}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\exists I\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists e,m\\\n(e\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,I)\\land m\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I,B)\\land f=m\\circ e\\land\\mathrm{IsRegularEpi}(e)\\land\\mathrm{IsMono}(m))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,B&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall e\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B&#39;,B)\\\n(\\mathrm{IsRegularEpi}(e)\\to\\forall P,p,e&#39;\\ (\\mathrm{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal E}(P,p,e&#39;,e,g)\\to\\mathrm{IsRegularEpi}(e&#39;))).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：IV.6 Factorization and Images，印刷页 184–189；Appendix.1 Exactness Conditions。旧 regular epi 定义中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 没有绑定，现从箭头的源靶读取。正则性要求正则满/单分解及正则满态射的拉回稳定性；普遍性质的存在由有限极限保证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\mathrm{dom}(e)","display":false},{"tex":"B=\\mathrm{cod}(e)","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsRegularEpi}(e)\\leftrightarrow{}&e\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists p,q\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(R,\\mathrm{dom}(e))\\\n\\bigl(e\\circ p=e\\circ q\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\mathrm{dom}(e),X)\\\n(h\\circ p=h\\circ q\\to\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\mathrm{cod}(e),X)\\ (u\\circ e=h))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsRegular}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\exists I\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists e,m\\\n(e\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,I)\\land m\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I,B)\\land f=m\\circ e\\land\\mathrm{IsRegularEpi}(e)\\land\\mathrm{IsMono}(m))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B,B'\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall e\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,B)\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B',B)\\\n(\\mathrm{IsRegularEpi}(e)\\to\\forall P,p,e'\\ (\\mathrm{IsPullback}_{\\mathcal E}(P,p,e',e,g)\\to\\mathrm{IsRegularEpi}(e'))).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A,B","display":false}],"bytes":2225,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-regular-epimorphism-regular-category|Definition — Regular Epimorphism and Regular Category]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-regular-epimorphism-regular-category]]"},{"id":"2835ef59873188e3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-regular-epimorphism-regular-category]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-regular-epimorphism-regular-category|Definition — Regular Epimorphism and Regular Category]]"},{"id":"fdb61df37dc1ecf7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 是有拉回的范畴，$e:A\\to B$ 满足 [[14-df-regular-epimorphism-regular-category]] 的 $\\mathrm{IsRegularEpi}(e)$；$(K,k_0,k_1)$ 是 [[14-df-kernel-pairs-and-effective-equivalence-relations]] 的核对，$k_0,k_1:K\\to A$。余等化子谓词的输入为同源靶箭头 $u,v:C\\to A$ 与候选 $q:A\\to Q$，$C,A,Q$ 均为本范畴对象。以下全部 $\\mathrm{Ob},\\mathrm{Hom}$、复合均取当前 $\\mathcal C$。"},{"id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯；$f:A\\to B$ 为箭头。$\\mathrm{IsRegular},\\mathrm{IsRegularEpi}$ 见 [[14-df-regular-epimorphism-regular-category]]。单态射同构类见 [[14-df-subobjects]]。"}],"outgoing":["4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","5c5452002ba29fda","199dc3cf97e92fa1"]}